  "description": "The proposed works comprise the installation of a new access gate to the rear of the property, located within the existing fence line. In addition, an internal fence will be constructed to serve the new gate, creating a separate and secure access route to the lower garden area only.\n\nThe materials used will be selected to best match the existing fence and surroundings. The height of the proposed gate and fencing will not exceed that of the current boundary treatment, and all works will be carried out in compliance with relevant fire safety regulations.\n\nThere is no change of use associated with the proposed works.",
